     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all,<div><br></div><div>when I run</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&gt; library(test_that)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&gt; test_dir(&quot;test&quot;)</font></div><div><br></div><div>my testthat tests are executed,</div><div><br></div><div>but</div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&gt; library(devtools)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&gt; test()</font></div><div><br></div><div>complains about </div><div> </div><div>     <font face=\"courier new, monospace\">Error: No testthat directories found in /home/uweschmitt/r_projects/uwetest/R/test_package </font><br></div><div><br></div><div>In both cases my working directory is the one given in the error message.</div><div><br></div><div>Any hints ?</div><div><br></div><div>Regards, Uwe</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "d1BgTz35x20J",
   "from": "Gregory Jefferis",
   "author": "7f0257cd1389289f",
   "date": "2014-04-04T14:06:44Z",
   "subject": "Re: devtools test() complains about missing testthat folder",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi Uwe,<div><br><div><div><div>On 4 Apr 2014, at 14:56, Uwe Schmitt wrote:</div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br>&gt; library(test_that)</font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&gt; test_dir(&quot;test&quot;)</font></div></span></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Your tests are not in a standard location. Your package needs to have a folder:</div><div><br></div><div>tests/<a href=\"https://github.com/jefferis/nat/tree/master/tests/testthat\" title=\"testthat\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);text-decoration:none;font-family:Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:18.200000762939453px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:nowrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferis/nat/tree/master/tests/testthat&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490058600000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lvTyET7J1twVcgybifyn4\">testthat</a></div><div><br></div><div>(or, no longer recommended, inst/tests)</div><div><br></div><div>containing your tests. </div><div><br></div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">&gt; library(devtools)</span></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">&gt; test()</font></div></blockquote></div><br><div>This will work now.</div><div><br></div><div>You can also have </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>check()</div><div><br></div><div>run your tests if you have a script like</div><div><br></div><div>tests/test-all.R</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:18px;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px;min-height:18px\">library<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span>testthat<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px;min-height:18px\">test_check<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;&lt;name_of_mypackage&gt;&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">)</span></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;padding-left:10px;min-height:18px\"><br></div></pre><div>There are lots of examples on github with this organisation. e.g.</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/jefferis/flycircuit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jefferis/flycircuit&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490058600000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0s4RTo88xFfFYF9dyTgigu\">https://github.com/jefferis/flycircuit</a></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div></div><div><br></div><div>Greg.</div></div></div><br><br><div>\r\n<span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:-webkit-auto;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;font-size:medium\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><div><div>--</div><div>Gregory Jefferis, PhD                      <br>Division of Neurobiology</div><div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">MRC Laboratory of Molecular Biology <br>Francis Crick Avenue<br>Cambridge Biomedical Campus<br>Cambridge, CB2 OQH, UK<br></div><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\"><br></div><a href=\"http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490058600000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15N151HngFA9A8VmVb-mcC\">http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis</a></div><div><a href=\"http://www.neuroscience.cam.ac.uk/directory/profile.php?gsxej2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.neuroscience.cam.ac.uk/directory/profile.php?gsxej2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490058600000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Cnmd_6keprEWQCS_LU3Du\">http://www.neuroscience.cam.ac.uk/directory/profile.php?gsxej2</a><br><a href=\"http://flybrain.stanford.edu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.stanford.edu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792490058600000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QcFhK8NktS5zE_XHXX_Dz\">http://flybrain.stanford.edu</a><br></div></div></div></span></div></span></span>\r\n</div>\r\n<br></div>"
